  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, the echo may use mirror power on an effect that has been cast or manifest within 1 more round, allowing the echo to replicate effects from the last 2 rounds. An echo without the cascade deeper reflection cannot echo their own effect. An echo gains additional lasting impressions at 9th, 13th, 17th, and 19th level.</p>\n<p>Other abilities may also benefit from lasting impression if their descriptions indicate it.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/echo#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
